   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm dyslexic and typing long messages is exhausting. Is voice typing any good these days?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.23,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's gotten really good. Tap the microphone on your keyboard and just talk. You can even say comma and full stop.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ugh, I feel silly talking to my phone in public though.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.17,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Lots of people feel that. You could use it at home for the long stuff and type short replies when you're out.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's fair. Does it learn",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "my weird words?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.87,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Mostly, yes. If it keeps getting a name wrong, add it to your personal dictionary in the keyboard settings.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait a second, that doesn't sound right.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_10",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Let me double-check. I'd still stand by it, but tell me what you heard.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg18"
  },
  {
